1
00:00:00,556 --> 00:00:02,286
A service is what you get.

2
00:00:02,826 --> 00:00:05,016
A mechanism is how you get it.

3
00:00:05,476 --> 00:00:10,206
X.800 lists specific and
pervasive mechanisms.

4
00:00:12,089 --> 00:00:17,219
Specific mechanisms protect a
single communication or data item.

5
00:00:17,659 --> 00:00:21,049
Each one does one job,
and several can be combined.

6
00:00:22,789 --> 00:00:23,959
Encipherment.

7
00:00:24,429 --> 00:00:26,799
Algorithms that transform data.

8
00:00:27,289 --> 00:00:28,899
Reversible is encryption.

9
00:00:30,329 --> 00:00:31,319
Irreversible is hashing.

10
00:00:33,022 --> 00:00:34,312
Digital signature.

11
00:00:34,972 --> 00:00:36,902
Data cryptographically signed.

12
00:00:37,417 --> 00:00:40,487
It gives authenticity and non-repudiation.

13
00:00:42,189 --> 00:00:43,419
Access control.

14
00:00:43,969 --> 00:00:46,639
Enforcement of authorities on resources.

15
00:00:47,404 --> 00:00:49,454
Only the right subjects get in.

16
00:00:51,949 --> 00:00:52,369
Data integrity.

17
00:00:52,914 --> 00:00:55,704
Cryptographic checksums over a data unit.

18
00:00:56,224 --> 00:00:57,454
Detects tampering.

19
00:00:59,256 --> 00:01:01,086
Three more specific mechanisms.

20
00:01:01,806 --> 00:01:03,316
Authentication exchange:

21
00:01:03,766 --> 00:01:06,616
information exchanged to assure identity.

22
00:01:07,261 --> 00:01:11,251
Traffic padding:
spurious data to thwart traffic analysis.

23
00:01:12,071 --> 00:01:13,201
Notarization:

24
00:01:13,671 --> 00:01:16,081
a trusted third party settles disputes.

25
00:01:18,429 --> 00:01:20,899
Pervasive mechanisms
span the whole system.

26
00:01:21,394 --> 00:01:22,844
Security key management:

27
00:01:23,274 --> 00:01:24,304
generation,

28
00:01:24,674 --> 00:01:26,304
distribution, protection.

29
00:01:26,889 --> 00:01:27,839
Trusted function:

30
00:01:28,349 --> 00:01:30,339
a process you can rely on.

31
00:01:31,956 --> 00:01:34,706
Mechanisms combine to implement services.

32
00:01:35,376 --> 00:01:38,866
Integrity plus authentication
via a keyed hash.

33
00:01:39,471 --> 00:01:45,001
Confidentiality plus non-repudiation
via encryption plus signature.

34
00:01:46,789 --> 00:01:48,159
Services say what.

35
00:01:48,644 --> 00:01:50,154
Mechanisms say how.

36
00:01:50,694 --> 00:01:52,564
The model ties them together.

